==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[Lione Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 30.67~36 seconds<sup>920f~1,080f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**2 [[Lione Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**1 [[Lione Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Spawn [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and spam [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]]s until your [[Worker Cat]] is level 8. Then you can just spam Wall Cat, [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], and Dragon Cat.
[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] is useful for dealing heavy damage to the Lione Hippoe and The Face.

